1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:02,610
When a cat's tail puffs up like a bottle brush,

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:05,190
it's the same thing that gives you goosebumps.

3
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:09,010
Every hair grows from a tiny pit with its own tiny muscle.

4
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,730
When the cat gets scared,

5
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:14,310
adrenaline hits, and thousands of those muscles squeeze at once.

6
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,070
The hairs stand straight up,

7
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,130
and the tail can look twice as thick.

8
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:21,120
Then the cat arches its back and turns sideways,

9
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:24,310
so whatever scared it sees the biggest cat possible.

10
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:28,220
Your goosebumps are left over from when our ancestors had fur.

11
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,710
So if your cat's tail ever puffs up,

12
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:32,000
give it some space, because
